# A realistic two-phase process: eight lanes, phase groups, several start
# chains, fork, collapsed subprocess placeholders, colours and documentation.
# covers: §4.6, §4.7, §4.8, §5, §7.4, §9, §9.1
title "Solar panel installation"
doc From signed order to a working installation and the first service visit.

pool Installer
  doc A regional installer of rooftop solar panels.
  lanes Sales [color: #E3F2FD], Credit control [color: #E3F2FD]
  lanes Planning [color: #FFF8E1], Warehouse [color: #FFF8E1]
  lanes Logistics [color: #FFF8E1], Field service [color: #E8F5E9]
  lanes Billing [color: #F3E5F5], Customer care [color: #F3E5F5]

  group Fulfilment
    lane Sales
    start message Order signed
    doc The customer has signed the quote in the portal.
    user Confirm order
    doc Check the quote against the site survey and confirm the order.
    lane Credit control
    sub Credit check [collapsed]
    doc Runs the standard credit check, documented in the credit manual.
    xor Credit approved? [doc: The credit check decides whether the order goes ahead.]
      yes:
        lane Planning
        user Plan installation
        doc Pick an installation date and a crew.
      no:
        lane Sales
        user Ask for deposit
        doc Ask the customer for a 30% deposit instead.
        catch message Deposit received
        doc The deposit has arrived in the bank account.
    lane Planning
    service Publish plan
    doc Publishes the plan to the warehouse and logistics systems.
    fork
      -
        lane Warehouse
        user Pick panels and inverter
        doc Pick the kit from stock and stage it at the loading bay.
      -
        lane Logistics
        user Book delivery van
        doc Book a van for the day before installation.
    lane Logistics
    task Deliver kit [stroke: #1F4E79]
    doc Deliver the kit to the customer's site.
    lane Field service
    sub Install panels [collapsed, color: #C8E6C9]
    doc Mount, wire and commission the panels, as in the installation manual.
    user Hand over installation
    doc Show the customer the app and the isolation switch.
    lane Billing
    service Send final invoice
    doc Invoice the remaining amount.
    end Installation complete
    doc The installation is live and invoiced.

  group After-sales [color: #FFF5F5]
    lane Customer care
    start timer Six months after installation
    doc Every installation gets a service visit after six months.
    user Call customer
    doc Agree a date for the service visit.
    lane Field service
    user Service visit [stroke: red]
    doc Clean the panels and check the inverter logs.
    xor Fault found? [doc: A fault is anything the inverter logs report.]
      yes:
        sub Repair [collapsed]
        doc Repairs follow the warranty process.
      no:
        lane Customer care
        manual File visit report
        doc File the signed report in the customer folder.
    lane Customer care
    end Visit closed
    doc The customer has a working installation.
    start message Complaint received
    doc A customer complains by phone or e-mail.
    user Log complaint
    doc Record the complaint and promise a call back within a day.
    lane Field service
    user Investigate complaint
    doc Visit the site if needed.
    lane Customer care
    end Complaint closed
    doc The customer has accepted the answer.
